Much like the [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Royal_Guard_1 Royal] [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Royal_Guard_2 Guards], Dogaressa changed alongside [http://undercards.wikia.com/wiki/Dogamy Dogamy]. Starting with 7G, she was reduced to 6G in '''Alpha 2.1''', and reduced further to 5G in '''Beta 2.6'''.

'''Beta 6.2''' dropped her ATK from 8 to 7, and her Magic, which made her gain +5 HP if you had an ally Dogamy, was dropped to give her +4. This means that after the effect, her stats will be 7/7 instead of 8/8. '''Beta 15.0''' nerfed her ability further by only giving +3 HP, and '''Beta 20.0''' nerfed her ATK to 6, making her max out at 6/6.

'''Beta 41.0''' reworked the card engine, which allowed 'aura' effects to work. This resulted in her getting reworked to passively gain +2 HP as long as you have a Dogamy in your hand. '''Beta 56.0''' gave her +1 HP, but changed her aura into a dust that gave +4 HP randomly split among all Dogs in your hand.
